  "system": {
    "description": "You can raise thralls: mindless dead that shamble at your word (see the Thrall stat block below). Thralls are mooks, not minions: they have 1 HP, any damage that gets through destroys them, they fail every test they would make, and creatures can move through their spaces as difficult terrain. Thralls do not count toward your minion limit. Command a thrall (◈) to spend its two actions; when it attacks, you make the attack with Sanity (DR12), and it counts toward your Bane for multiple attacks. Thralls collapse when the encounter ends, or after 10 minutes outside combat.",
